# Home Mate B — data/env.local template (values are secrets; this file is
# gitignored on every machine and NEVER committed with values filled in).
# The core loads it at startup (keys only enter the process environment;
# per-service keys can alternatively be set through the console 服务 page,
# which stores them in the SQLite secrets table write-only).
#
# LLM (GLM): key from ~/.hermes/.env GLM_API_KEY on the dev machine.
GLM_API_KEY=

# TTS (Volcano seed-tts-2.0): key = VOLC_API_KEY (from 5.168 RUI secrets).
VOLC_API_KEY=

# ASR (optional on NAS): oMLX on the dev Mac exposes /v1/audio/transcriptions.
# Point base_url at the Mac's LAN address if oMLX is exposed on LAN;
# 127.0.0.1 works only when the ASR service runs on the same host.
# Console 服务页 asr: provider=openai-asr, model=Qwen3-ASR-0.6B-bf16 (or -4bit).
